  <note><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(15,23,42,1)"><p>Ten matched 4,997-parameter arms were screened on train and development only; independent development cluster-balanced MSE selected all at 3.761769367012553 from 503 rows and 447 clusters. Frozen sequence-OOD evaluation used 1,336 rows, 1,110 operational protein clusters, 2,000 cluster bootstrap replicates, and Holm correction within six comparisons. For all versus none, Spearman delta was 0.19901564752464795 with CI [0.12925907591173844, 0.26781646706339085] and Holm p=0, while CB-MSE delta was -0.2760885716873087 with CI [-0.37608880535590633, -0.18123318545616485] and Holm p=0; for all versus ridge_all, the corresponding values were -0.025779039513507546, CI [-0.0755256519724216, 0.020488139619787824], Holm p=0.532, and -0.025572097048845777, CI [-0.1282439258338166, 0.07253420347846523], Holm p=0.636; for all versus ridge_gc, they were 0.12022060447388114, CI [0.0819592276678431, 0.1602983907730725], Holm p=0, and -0.2895163999162387, CI [-0.3565435053891241, -0.226815730607076], Holm p=0. The full-proxy ridge comparison did not meet either endpoint criterion, so channel_screen_gate_pass and RK-G1 remain false; the 19,072 functional-untouched rows were not evaluated, the velocity endpoint remains failed, and generator training is unauthorized. Independent verification passed 320/320 with maximum numeric delta 1.9095836023552692e-14, targeted tests passed 8/8, and finalization passed 42/42; manuscript v31 section 6.27 and GitHub commit 7d5e51a17f93218e831bc22b845c030065362a35 record the result.</p></content></note>
